# Local configuration template

Copy to `CLAUDE.local.md`, which is ignored by Git. Use paths for your machine.
Do not store credentials or account details here.

- Dataset root (immutable): /path/to/research-data
- Generated views: /path/to/research-views
- Runs root: /path/to/research-runs
- Artifact cache: /path/to/research-runs/cache
- Index: /path/to/research-runs/index/runs.sqlite3
- Audit log: /path/to/research-runs/audit.jsonl
- Temporary files: /path/to/research-runs/tmp

Keep these directories outside the checkout. Select worker and memory limits
for your machine. Preserve the engine's BLAS thread clamps in parallel workers.
